Implement src/exact.rs: BigQ privately wraps normalized BigRational; BigC exposes re/im BigQ. Exact From<i64> and From<Q> for BigQ/BigC, From<C> for BigC; zero Default; decimal parse, new(BigInt,BigInt,&mut Budget), getters and fallible small conversion. Budgeted checked add/sub/mul/div/neg/pow; typed computation errors. Check zero denominators before normalization. Preflight input bytes and conservative decimal bits (four per digit), operand/intermediate bits and charge bit-weighted work before arithmetic. Limits constrain declared arithmetic work, not OS allocation or wall time. Conservative rejection before cancellation is permitted. Implement frozen Coefficient for BigC. No shared polynomial implementation. Tests must include independent large decimal fixtures and legacy comparisons.
